		},
		{
			"id": "e65c465a6234c36f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-task**\nstart, work in the repository, progress, verify, done with its result",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "334c77e0d5ee575f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Ready tasks with no dependency between them may run in subagents, one task each",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "edf2a853d0327b45",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Every task done or dropped?",
			"x": 380,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a24ebe732aee80fd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-receipt**\nthread-review, then the receipt",
			"x": 720,
			"y": -140,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dc6f7c70fdc4467c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-sync**: the spec and the receipt, as one change",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": -130,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0afffdd65e3dd4fa",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Stub",
			"x": -1400,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "d47dd4ef3770ca7a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Spec",
			"x": -1080,
			"y": 120,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "77c35b05b7873312",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Receipt",
			"x": 720,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "c81226b3bb2bf411",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "The spec and the receipt are pending until a change absorbs them. The first draft's \"Wikify stub\" and \"Wikify spec\" steps become this one sync at the end. A stub becomes pending too when `wikify` lists `stub`.",
			"x": -1400,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "df23ee6482a96b03",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-work** reads the Thread View's `next` at each step: spec, tasks, task T<n>, or receipt",
			"x": -1400,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "4fdbce5e596f0e63",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -2000,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
